} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/75902"} "89 from 16 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Between 1920-1960, the team épée was a virtual two-nation race between France and Italy, with Italy winning the gold medal six times and France three. But 1924 was a French year. The two dominant countries made the final pool, along with Belgium and Portugal. The match between France and Italy was almost a tie, both winning eight bouts, but France won the match on touches delivered, 21-20. With easy victories over Belgium and Portugal, France was assured the gold medal. In an upset, Belgium also defeated Italy to garner the silver medal."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "France"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/21874"} "Lucien Gaudin"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21763"} "Géo Buchard"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21846"} "Roger Ducret"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/22056"} "Georges Tainturier"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21910"} "André Labatut"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21944"} "Alexandre Lippmann"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21943"} "Robert Liottel"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/21784"} "Gaston Cornereau"] [:small {} " (DNS)"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "Belgium"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BEL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BEL.png"}] "BEL"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athlet